<span class="badge badge-warning">Security Action</span>
<h1>Reset Your CampusCare Password</h1>
<p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset the password for your CampusCare account. To set up a new password, click the button below within the next 60 minutes:</p>

<div style="margin: 24px 0; text-align: center;">
  {{button "Reset Account Password" actionUrl}}
</div>

<p>If you did not make this request, you can safely ignore this email. Your current password will remain secure, and no changes will be made to your account profile.</p>

<div class="meta-box" style="background-color: #f1f5f9;">
  <p style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">
    <strong>Security Warning:</strong> Never share this link or copy it. Campus IT Administration will never ask for password reset links or authorization tokens via mail.
  </p>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Regards,<br/>CampusCare Security Infrastructure Team</p>
